# nox scan output. These are regenerated by every scan and their content is
# finding fingerprints, so they also re-trip the secret detector when scanned —
# .nox.yaml excludes the same paths for that reason.
#
# results.sarif is what a local `nox scan -format sarif` writes here; CI writes
# nox-results/results.sarif, covered by the directory above. Named rather than
# globbed as *.sarif, so a SARIF file from another tool is not silently hidden.
#
# .nox/baseline.json is NOT ignored: the waiver list is deliberately tracked.
findings.json
nox-results/
results.sarif
